00:05:36.703 --> 00:05:38.104
It was unfounded, doctor,

00:05:38.104 --> 00:05:39.872
but it was very prevalent.

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:40.907
We all heard it.

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:43.176
Do you have any hesitation at this point?

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:44.310
About recommending the

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:45.812
COVID vaccine to young men

00:05:47.347 --> 00:05:49.148
to who we are currently recommending?

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:51.451
I don't have any of the data now.

00:05:51.818 --> 00:05:54.053
My mind is quite strong

00:05:54.053 --> 00:05:55.621
for the safety of this

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:57.056
and the potential benefit

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:58.591
related to the vaccine.

00:05:58.591 --> 00:05:59.592
So I think us

00:05:59.592 --> 00:05:59.892
should be

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:01.894
commended for the emergency action plan

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:03.996
